### `Server link is never read`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| The radio accepts a peer and the invite never queues | Listening opened the socket and nobody subscribed the inbound stream | When listening starts, subscribe inbound and drain each link |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `Answer clears the invite that was just promoted`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| The next invite never opens after Accept or Decline | The UI nulls the prompt slot after the handler that already stored the next prompt | Clear the slot only when it still holds the prompt being answered, and do that before the handler runs |

